<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53404" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρπᾰσος</span></b> , ἡ, with
		heterocl. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρπασα</span>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>AP</u>
			9.415.6
		</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
			Antiphil.
		</span></i>, with play on the meanings 'sails' and 'clothes'); also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάλπᾰσος</span></b> 
			(q.v.):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>flax,
				Linum usitatissimum</i> (or perh.<i>L. angustifolium</i>),
				<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				2.68
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				736
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>cotton,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Peripl.M.Rubr.
				41
			</span></i> (cf. Skt.<i>karpāsas</i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρπασον</span></b> , τό, <i>white hellebore, Veratrum album</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>A.</u>
				922
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀπὸς καρπάσου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archig.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.445
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				<u>Alex.</u>
				13
			</span></i>; <i>sucus carpathi</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				32.58
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀποκάρπασον,
			καρπησία</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
